      <h2>Which one do you need?</h2>
      <p>A standard removals company is usually the cheaper choice for a simple move with plenty of help. Chayce Properties is the better fit when you want the whole move handled: sorting, packing, insured removal, estate agent and solicitor liaison and settling in, through one coordinator.</p>
      <p>The table below compares the three options. Where a standard removals firm varies, check the details with the company you are considering.</p>
