      <div class="area-body">
      <h2>How to decide</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Choose a standard removals company if the move is small, nearby, and family can sort and pack.</li>
        <li>Choose Chayce if you are downsizing a family home, moving without nearby family, or arranging a parent's move.</li>
        <li>Do it yourself only if you have time, help and a short, simple move.</li>
      </ul>
