    <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
    <div class="pkg-faq">
      <details><summary>Is Chayce cheaper than a standard removals company?</summary><p>Not for a simple van-and-crew move. A standard removals firm will often cost less if you only need transport. Chayce is for people who want the whole move handled, with packages from &pound;995.</p></details>
      <details><summary>What is the difference between a removals company and a senior move manager?</summary><p>A removals company transports your belongings. A senior move manager also plans the move, helps sort and pack, liaises with your estate agent and solicitor, and helps you settle in.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Can I use a removals company and still use Chayce for the sorting?</summary><p>Talk to us about your situation. A Discovery Consultation, &pound;150, will set out the best split of work and the cost.</p></details>
